1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:03,750
Agar aap Surat mein AC, fridge,

2
00:00:03,750 --> 00:00:06,800
ya washing machine repair karte hai,

3
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:08,650
toh yeh scene aapko roz dikhta hoga.

4
00:00:08,650 --> 00:00:15,650
Ek shared lead aati hai aur 5 technicians aise race lagate hai jaise ring road par subah ka traffic khul gaya ho.

5
00:00:15,650 --> 00:00:19,300
Aur uske baad customer ka favourite dialogue.

6
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:22,300
Bhaiya, dusre wale ne toh 200 kam bola hai.

7
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:28,500
Asal baat yeh hai ki aaj kal log garmi mein bahar nikal kar shop ka board nahi dhoondhte.

8
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:31,050
Woh seedha Instagram aur Facebook scroll karte hai.

9
00:00:31,050 --> 00:00:34,650
Aur jiska video ya ad samne dikh gaya, usko call laga dete hai.

10
00:00:36,300 --> 00:00:39,500
Isiliye smart technicians ab hyper local targeting use kar rahe hai.

11
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:42,600
Iska matlab pure Surat ko ad dikhana nahi hai.

12
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:49,300
Kyunki Varachha mein baith kar Vesu ki ek chhoti si enquiry ke liye jana petrol aur time dono ka nuksan hai.

13
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:55,750
Yeh system sirf aapke 5 se 10 kilometer ke area mein unhi logo ko pakadta hai jinhe sach mein repair chahiye.

14
00:00:56,400 --> 00:00:59,800
Isme sabse bada fayda yeh hai ki beech mein koi middle man nahi hota.

15
00:00:59,800 --> 00:01:03,850
Customer seedha aapke WhatsApp par message karta hai ya call lagata hai.

16
00:01:04,250 --> 00:01:09,150
Jab unke paas 5 logo ke number nahi hote toh faltu ki bargaining bhi nahi hoti.

17
00:01:09,150 --> 00:01:12,850
Aur har enquiry sirf aur sirf aapki hoti hai.

18
00:01:13,150 --> 00:01:14,450
Thoda simple maths samjhiye.

19
00:01:14,450 --> 00:01:18,500
Ek normal fridge ya washing machine repair mein jo margin bachta hai.

20
00:01:18,500 --> 00:01:21,650
Usse aapke kayi dino ka ad kharcha aaram se nikal aata hai.

21
00:01:21,650 --> 00:01:25,550
Yaani kaam bhi regular aata hai aur apna rate bhi nahi girana padta.

22
00:01:25,550 --> 00:01:29,200
Toh agar aap bhi yeh pura system detail mein samajhna chahte hai.

23
00:01:29,200 --> 00:01:37,320
Toh bio mein link hai, uspe click kijiye aur dekhiye kaise kayi technicians daily naye kaam la rahe hai bina koi paisa kam kiye.
